00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:39.100
Go on. Kneel in front of me
and admit defeat.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:42.640
You don't need to do that, Lisara.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:48.660
You people don't get it at all.

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.740
Ryousuke...

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:55.290
The position of this Venus, and the way she covers herself with her hands... It's sublime beauty!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:59.260
Yes, this is what Lisara is trying to tell you.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.300
We are all born into this world naked.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.300
Toss aside the swimsuit and go into the sea!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:07.680
And this is from me!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:12.220
May all people who swim in the seas of the world have nudist beaches!

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:16.940
The ultimate swimsuit is
the skin we were born with!

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.990
That's our leader for you.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:30.910
You're the greatest ero-pinion leader ever!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.160
Well, it wasn't really what I expected.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:38.540
Yeah. Let's go.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:40.880
Man, this was a good show.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.560
Ryousuke sure is something!

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:43.440
Wait!

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:44.680
Where are you going?!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.430
Don't ignore me!

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:49.600
Close call!

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:54.120
Lisara!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:58.580
Just you wait. I'll get you next time!

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:02.040
What's this?

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.620
Fukumune Iria mysteriously withdraws!

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:06.720
Which means that...

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:10.910
The winner of the first ever Momozono Academy Swimsuit Contest is...

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.780
Kaga Lisara!

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:23.630
So Merlot had this data all along.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:25.660
Lisara.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:26.980
Good work today.

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:29.640
Ryousuke, what are you doing?

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.880
What? This?

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:34.810
The ultimate swimsuit,
the skin I was born with!

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:37.980
I feel like I've been freed from everything!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.150
Come on, Lisara, you should try it!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:49.400
Did you really expect that to work?!
